  "blocks": {
    "text-7": {
      "id": "text-7",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "paragraph-4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "网页提供全文搜索：搜索“星河笔记”，结果会定位到这一句。"
            },
            {
              "type": "extension",
              "kind": "presmium.mdast",
              "schemaVersion": 1,
              "data": {
                "node": {
                  "type": "footnoteReference",
                  "identifier": "reading-footnote",
                  "label": "reading-footnote"
                }
              },
              "fallback": "[注]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "paragraph-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "页内链接可以跳到文稿的任一页，例如"
            },
            {
              "type": "link",
              "href": "#scope",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "“按媒介输出”"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "footnote-definition",
          "type": "extension",
          "kind": "presmium.mdast",
          "schemaVersion": 1,
          "data": {
            "node": {
              "type": "footnoteDefinition",
              "identifier": "reading-footnote",
              "label": "reading-footnote",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "value": "脚注适合放出处与补充说明：读者需要时再看，正文读起来不被打断。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "fallback": [
            {
              "id": "paragraph-6",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "脚注适合放出处与补充说明：读者需要时再看，正文读起来不被打断。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web",
        "notebook"
      ]
    },
    "text-8": {
      "id": "text-8",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "sp-2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "讲课时，从右上角的视图菜单进入放映。放映中可以用画笔在页面上标注，也可以黑屏或冻结画面，把听众的注意力引回讲者。演讲者视图另开一个窗口，显示当前页、下一页和讲稿。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web",
        "notebook"
      ]
    },
    "web-only": {
      "id": "web-only",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "paragraph-15",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "这一段只在网页中显示。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web"
      ]
    },
    "notebook-only": {
      "id": "notebook-only",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "paragraph-16",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "这一段只在 notebook 中显示。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "notebook"
      ]
    },
    "text-18": {
      "id": "text-18",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "sp-3",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "内容块的 "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "only",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " 字段列出显示它的媒介，没有 "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "only",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " 的块在所有媒介中显示。下面两段分别限定为网页和 notebook，所以网页和 notebook 各只显示其中一段；幻灯片两段都不显示，改为显示一行为放映准备的文字。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web",
        "notebook"
      ]
    },
    "text-20": {
      "id": "text-20",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "sp-4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "文稿可以带一个本地插件，注册自己的网页组件（Web Component）。下面的计数器由本文稿 "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "plugin",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " 目录中的插件注册，初值为 2，每点击一次加一。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web",
        "notebook"
      ]
    },
    "text-23": {
      "id": "text-23",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "web-component-node",
          "type": "extension",
          "kind": "presmium.mdast",
          "schemaVersion": 1,
          "data": {
            "node": {
              "type": "html",
              "value": "<presmium-feature-counter label=\"Web Component\" start=\"2\"></presmium-feature-counter>"
            }
          },
          "fallback": [
            {
              "id": "paragraph-22",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Web Component 计数器，初值 2，点击后增加。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "contrast": {
      "id": "contrast",
      "type": "component",
      "definitionId": "contrast-definition",
      "parameters": {}
    },
    "text-24": {
      "id": "text-24",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "sp-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "高对比度开关提高文字与背景的对比度，视力较弱的读者和明亮教室里的投影都更容易看清。发布后的网页可以保存到本地，断网时照常阅读。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web",
        "notebook"
      ]
    },
    "text-27": {
      "id": "text-27",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "sp-6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "这份文稿有中文与英文两个版本，读者用语言菜单在两者之间切换。译文与原文的页面、内容块和步骤一一对应。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web",
        "notebook"
      ]
    },
    "text-30": {
      "id": "text-30",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "sp-7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "读者可以在阅读页用“提问”就内容向 AI 提问，所用的模型服务由读者自己配置。课堂上，AI 的回答先经主讲审阅，再发送给全班。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web",
        "notebook"
      ]
    },
    "text-33": {
      "id": "text-33",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "sp-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "网页、notebook、学生版以及 PDF、图片与 PowerPoint 都从这一份 lecture.json 生成：内容只写一次，每次构建后各种输出彼此一致。下面前两条命令分别构建网页与 notebook、构建学生版网页；"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "presmium-export --help",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " 列出 PDF、图片与 PowerPoint 的导出方式。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web",
        "notebook"
      ]
    },
    "export-commands": {
      "id": "export-commands",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "shell",
      "value": "presmium build showcase-publishing --to web,notebook\npresmium build showcase-publishing --to web --audience student\n# presmium-export --help 查看 PDF、图片与 PowerPoint 导出"
    },
    "g-read-intro": {
      "id": "g-read-intro",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "g-read-intro-p",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "一份文稿发布之后，读者和作者各得到一组功能。读者在网页上可以全文搜索、查看脚注、进入放映、切换高对比度与译文，也可以就内容向 AI 提问；作者用同一份 lecture.json 按媒介筛选内容、加入自己的网页组件，并输出网页、notebook、学生版与 PDF、图片、PowerPoint。本部分的五页演示读者一侧的功能。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web",
        "notebook"
      ]
    },
    "g-output-intro": {
      "id": "g-output-intro",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "g-output-intro-p",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "作者一侧，同一份文稿面向不同媒介：内容块可以限定在部分媒介中显示，本地插件可以加入自定义网页组件，构建与导出命令输出网页、notebook、学生版与 PDF、图片、PowerPoint。本部分的三页依次演示。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web",
        "notebook"
      ]
    },
